# build/reflaxe-cpp.hxml — shared reflaxe.CPP configuration.
#
# Include this from any hxml that targets C++.  Paths are relative to the REPOSITORY ROOT:
# every script cds there first, and every hxml here assumes it.
#
# The two -p lines are not optional. reflaxe.CPP ships its standard library under std/ and its
# core-type overrides under std/cxx/_std, and declares them in haxelib.json's "reflaxe.stdPaths".
# That declaration is only consumed by `haxelib run reflaxe` (which flattens a release build);
# a plain `-lib reflaxe.cpp` against a source checkout does NOT pick it up, and you get
# "Type not found : cxx.Compiler". Verified 2026-08-08 — see PROGRESS.md [M0-VERIFY] #1.

-lib reflaxe.cpp
-p vendor/reflaxe.CPP/std
-p vendor/reflaxe.CPP/std/cxx/_std
